 used, and the user\n  is not be able to enroll in a beta program using their logged in Apple ID. The device\n  is automatically enrolled into the beta program specified by the `RequireProgram` key if\n  it is present. Otherwise, the programs listed in the `OfferPrograms` key are\n  presented to the user to choose which to enroll with.\n* \"AlwaysOff\" - The device is not allowed to enroll in any beta programs. The device is\n  removed from any beta programs, if already enrolled.","categoryId":"b382d980-7459-4850-a45e-75dd99488972","offsetUri":"Beta/ProgramEnrollment","rootDefinitionId":"softwareupdate_softwareupdate","uxBehavior":"default","applicability":{"platform":"iOS,macOS","technologies":"appleRemoteManagement"},"defaultOptionId":"softwareupdate_beta_programenrollment_0","options":[{"itemId":"softwareupdate_beta_programenrollment_0","displayName":"Allowed","dependedOnBy":[]},{"itemId":"softwareupdate_beta_programenrollment_1","displayName":"AlwaysOn","dependedOnBy":[]},{"itemId":"softwareupdate_beta_programenrollment_2","displayName":"AlwaysOff","dependedOnBy":[]}]},{"@odata.type":"#microsoft.graph.deviceManagementConfigurationChoiceSettingDefinition","id":"softwareupdate_recommendedcadence","name":"RecommendedCadence","displayName":"Recommendation Cadence","description":"Specifies how the device shows software updates to the user. When more than one update is available update, the device behaves as follows:\n* \"All\" - Shows all software update versions.\n* \"Oldest\" - Shows only the oldest (lower numbered) software update version.\n* \"Newest\" - Shows only the newest (highest numbered) software update version. Only applicable on Supervised devices with iOS 18+ and MacOS 15+","categoryId":"b382d980-7459-4850-a45e-75dd99488972","offsetUri":"RecommendedCadence","rootDefinitionId":"softwareupdate_softwareupdate","uxBehavior":"default","applicability":{"platform":"iOS","technologies":"appleRemoteManagement"},"defaultOptionId":"softwareupdate_recommendedcadenc